<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>反民粹与反邪 on 安知生 angelife</title><link>https://angelife.github.io/categories/%E5%8F%8D%E6%B0%91%E7%B2%B9%E4%B8%8E%E5%8F%8D%E9%82%AA/</link><description>Recent content in 反民粹与反邪 on 安知生 angelife</description><generator>Hugo -- 0.147.4</generator><language>zh-cn</language><copyright>2009–2026 angelife / 安知生</copyright><lastBuildDate>Tue, 26 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://angelife.github.io/categories/%E5%8F%8D%E6%B0%91%E7%B2%B9%E4%B8%8E%E5%8F%8D%E9%82%AA/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>反民粹，不反民众</title><link>https://angelife.github.io/series/anti-populism/anti-populism-not-anti-people/</link><pubDate>Tue, 26 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://angelife.github.io/series/anti-populism/anti-populism-not-anti-people/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="结论">结论&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>反民粹，不是反普通人。反的是把普通人的痛苦加工成仇恨、把真实困境包装成操弄工具、把复杂问题简化为敌我动员。&lt;/p>
&lt;h1 id="背景">背景&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>民粹最危险的地方，在于它常常借真实痛苦起势。它先承认你的委屈，再偷换你的判断，最后把你带入一个只能仇恨、不能思考的结构。&lt;/p>
&lt;h1 id="核心判断">核心判断&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>真正的正见，既不能轻视民众的处境，也不能纵容操盘者借民众之名制造仇恨。反操弄，才是对人的尊重。&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>